{"ASK_MISS","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hot showers -- God, hot showers, I'd give my right arm, no, my left, I'm right-handed","My bed... my stupid bed, I miss my pillow so much I've started to dream about it!","Coffee, real coffee, from a pot, in a mug that says \"World's Best Dad\"","Normal! just normal, a Tuesday, a boring Tuesday, a boring Tuesday with the TV on","T-the sound of the dishwasher running... it's so dumb, I miss the dishwasher","Ice, ice in a glass of sweet tea, I'm serious, I almost cried over the thought of ice","My mom's meatloaf, I used to complain about it, can you believe that, I used to COMPLAIN","Football on Sunday, even when my team was terrible, ESPECIALLY then","Sleeping, I mean really sleeping, all the way through, no listening for every little noise","Air conditioning, it's Kentucky, do I need to say more!!","My friends, we'd go to the lake, drink warm beer, argue about nothing, now I don't even know who's alive","Being bored! I miss being so bored I'd just stare at the ceiling, wow, what I wouldn't give","Music, the radio, I miss the stupid songs, even the ones I hated, I'd sing along to anything","Toothpaste, no joke, I'd marry toothpaste","Not being scared, I know that's not a thing you can hold, but it's what I miss most"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,5",{"Yesterday, honestly, yesterday I was just- I was at work, complaining about my boss","Friday, I miss Friday, I had plans, we were gonna grill out, I bought the steaks, they're in a freezer somewhere","This week's TV, my show was on Thursday, and I never got to see how it ended"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Quiet, real quiet, the kind that doesn't have something in it listening","Having a plan for the week, I used to plan for Saturday, now I plan for the next hour","My wife's laugh, I can't remember the sound of it anymore and that scares me worse than the dead","Lights, flipping a switch and the room just coming on, nobody warned me I'd miss that","Garbage day, I'm telling you, the trucks rumbling by, I miss garbage day","Strangers! walking through a store and there's strangers and none of 'em want to kill me","Riding in a car with the windows down... singing, ahh, God","Sunday dinners, forty people in the yard, everybody fighting about the potato salad","The smell of cut grass -- I know it's stupid, but I'd stand in the yard and smell it for an hour","Being useful in a normal way, like fixing a faucet instead of... all this"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|st=friendly",{"This right here, honestly, someone to talk to who isn't trying to take something or kill me","Having someone ask, you know, nobody's asked in days, thank you, I miss THIS, a person who cares","Friends, laughing, but you're doing alright by me, you remind me of what it was like"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=civilian_man,civilian_woman|st=careful",{"Why? what do you want me to say, that I miss my stuff, so you know where it is?","I miss minding my own business, you want to get started on that?","Not you, that's for sure"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=civilian_loner",{"Black coffee and a morning paper, in that order, then my day could go to hell and I'd be fine","Hearing a screen door slam, I don't know why, I just do","The Reds on the radio, a ball game in the evening, ball games were all the company I needed","Having a place to be, there was always somewhere to be, now I just keep walking","Cold beer on a porch, I think about it every day, pop top, first sip, that sigh","Biscuits and sausage gravy, you ever had a diner breakfast with the bell on the door? I miss that bell","My dog, Hank, I miss Hank so much I talk to a stump, like it's Hank","Fishing without looking over my shoulder, just sitting on a bank with a line in the water","Knowing what day it is, I've lost track, did I mention that? I lost track..","Nobody bothering me, ironic, huh, I wanted nobody bothering me, and now I've got it","My old truck, bench seat, AM radio, ran like a top, parked at the plant, probably still there","Real shoes, not wet boots, some days I wish I had somebody's feet"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=civilian_loner|st=careful",{"I miss being left alone, and you're not helping","Ain't telling you that","I miss privacy -- and I'm losing it right NOW"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=family_man,family_woman",{"Bedtime stories with the kids... God, I miss bedtime, even the stupid glass of water routine","My wife's cooking, hers, not mine, mine is awful, hers was an event","Saturday morning cartoons, my boy and I, cereal for breakfast, in our pajamas","Date night... just one, a movie, bad popcorn, her hand in the dark","Going to church on Sunday and not listening to a word, and then judging the casserole table","A phone that rang... can you believe that? I miss the phone ringing, someone calling who wanted something from me","School drop-off, the line of cars, the crossing guard, I'd be so happy to be annoyed at that line","Our old couch, ugly, plaid, cigarette burns, so comfortable you'd lose a day on it","A day where nobody's crying, just one day","My husband's hands, that's all, I'm sorry, just- his hands"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=family_man,family_woman|st=friendly",{"The way a house felt on a Sunday afternoon, sun in the windows, everybody home, doing nothing","Just getting through a whole meal without jumping, you know?","Honestly, someone being kind, like you right now, I miss that"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=family_elder",{"Church on Sunday, the whole choir, every voice I knew, I'd pay anything to hear Mildred flat on the high note","My own bed, and my husband snoring in it, I'd put up with it forever","The grandkids running through the house, I used to yell at them, God forgive me, I yelled at them","Gardening, my tomatoes, I had the biggest tomatoes on Pike Road, nobody even came by for the green ones","A good cup of tea and a crossword, in the quiet, with a cat in my lap","Doctor's appointments! the waiting room with the old magazines, can you imagine, I miss waiting","My radio programs, the preacher at noon, and the farm report, I loved that farm report","Church bake sales, honestly, I'd kill for a slice of Dorothy's pound cake","Peace, honey, I miss peace, all of it, whatever you call it, the whole thing"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=family_elder|st=careful",{"That's between me and the Lord!","Missing doesn't help, so I don't","Everything"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=family_youth",{"Everything, EVERYTHING, my friends, my room, my posters, even school, even Mister Teller's class!","My tape player, it ran out of batteries, and I almost cried, I'm not kidding","Pizza, any pizza, a bad pizza, a cardboard pizza, I'd weep","Saturday nights, cruising up and down Main, no destination, just loud music","The mall! just walking around the mall doing nothing, I miss doing nothing","My girlfriend... we were gonna go to prom, we didn't, and now it doesn't matter, does it...","My bike... my stupid bike, I rode it everywhere, it was a piece of junk, and I loved it","Video games, I know, how can I say that, with all that's happened, but I miss 'em","Soda, cold soda, in a can, with the little pop, and the fizz that burns your nose","Summer! Summer, I miss summer, it's still summer and I miss it"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=family_youth|st=careful",{"Don't talk to me about missing things, you don't know me"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=worker",{"Payday! A real one, with a stub... God, I miss a deposit slip!","My work boots by the door... my coffee thermos, the radio at the shop, the guys giving me hell...","A cold beer after a shift, my feet up, the ballgame on, honestly, that's all I ever wanted","My wife's pork chops, my boy's terrible jokes, my own chair, what else is there","Going home, going home with sore hands and a full lunch pail, going home","The sound of the shop... impact wrenches, compressors, the clang, everything now is too damn quiet","Friday, the feeling of Friday afternoon, you ever feel that? your whole body knows it","Lunch breaks! the whole crew in the break room telling lies, nine people laughing","Fixing things, I miss fixing things that stayed fixed","A paved road without a body on it, that's my whole list, and it isn't long"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=worker|st=careful",{"Not saying, so drop it","I miss paying attention to my own stuff, you should try it"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=rescue_medical",{"Sleep, my body is so tired I've started hallucinating the beep of the monitors","A hot meal I didn't cook myself, a plate someone put in front of me","My patients... the regulars, the ones who brought cookies, I keep wondering about them","Being able to help, I miss that, I miss being a nurse instead of a, a quartermaster of bandages","My kids' bedtime, I miss reading to them, I haven't read a book in two weeks","Clean scrubs, fresh coffee, the chair in the break room, so stupid, the chair","The hospital cafeteria, the lousy lasagna, I'd eat it cold, I'd eat it burnt","Handwashing, running water, a sink, a sink with warm water, God, a sink","My husband's cooking... he can't cook -- he burns everything, I miss it"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=rescue_medical|st=careful",{"What I miss is a life without strangers asking me for things!!","That's not something I discuss","Nothing, I miss nothing, I've got no time to miss"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=rescue_clergy",{"Singing, my dear, a whole congregation lifting up one hymn, the noise of it in the rafters","The Sunday potluck, the loud, boring, wonderful potluck","A full pew, I used to count the empty ones, now I'd give anything for an empty one, it would mean nobody died","Communion bread, I know, I know, it's silly, but I miss the little cups of grape juice","Confession on a Saturday, the little ordinary sins, not these ones, not this..","Funerals for old people, long, boring, well-attended, with a ham","The sound of children running in the aisle... I used to shush them, God forgive me","A bell, the church bell, I rang it every Sunday, and it's silent now, I won't ring it, it'd draw them","Weddings! oh, the weddings, bad cake, drunk uncles, the whole thing"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=rescue_clergy|st=careful",{"What I miss is peace, and I'm not getting it from you","My faith is what's left, ask about something else","Peace"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Engine house coffee, the pot that never got washed, tasted like tar, I miss it","My bunk, my locker, my crew's stupid jokes, my stupid crew","A call that ended well, a kid out of a tree, a cat down from a ladder, a quiet false alarm","Fourth of July parades, I drove the engine, with the siren on, waving at kids, I should've been on it this year","The sound of a pager with a normal fire, a kitchen fire, a chimney fire, a stupid grill...","Training days, chasing a rookie with a hose, laughing like we were twelve","A day shift where the worst thing was paperwork","Going home to a shower after smoke, I miss washing it off"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=rescue_firefighter|st=careful",{"I miss NOT being asked questions by people I don't know"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=militia",{"A good steak, a night with the guys at the lodge, cards, bad jokes, rifles on the wall","Hunting season... honestly, October, orange hat, thermos, sitting in a stand for six hours with my boy..","Friday night football, the band, the cold, the smell of popcorn, I'd give a lot for that","My recliner, a game on, and nothing to defend but the remote","My own roof... my own porch -- my own dog, dog's gone, porch is a battlefield, roof's gone, so, that's that","Being able to say \"it's nothing\" and be right"}},
{"ASK_MISS","role=militia|st=careful",{"Who asks that? what I miss isn't for sale!"}},
{"ASK_MISS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"Everything, everything, I miss waking up not afraid, I miss that most","I miss my bed... my locked -- safe bed, and my mom's voice in the next room","I miss being bored, bored is such a luxury, I didn't know","I miss my phone ringing, the stupid shrill ring, even the telemarketers","I miss feeling safe","I miss NOT jumping at every sound"},false,false,{[5]={{t="I didn't know it was a thing you could lose",afterMs=3500},{t="I thought you just had it",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_MISS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral|mood=grim",{"Nothing... I've learned to stop missing things, it's cheaper that way","The sound of a truck going by, just a truck, just a truck","Coffee... a cigarette, a hot meal, a door that locks, in that order"}},
{"ASK_MISS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"I miss her, I miss her, I miss her, the rest is noise","My dad's laugh... it was so loud... it filled the whole house... I can't remember it exactly","Sunday mornings... my kids' cartoons... the smell of pancakes... I'd trade anything","I miss the sound of her humming in the kitchen","I miss being tucked in","I miss my dog's snoring","Honestly? I miss the version of me who got to be bored on a Tuesday","I miss Sunday dinners","Her laugh.. just her.. laugh.. that's.. that's all.. I.. sorry..","Everything!!! everything, EVERYTHING, every stupid little thing","My bed, my dog, my mother's pie, my life.. my.. oh God..","Breakfast with the kids.. noisy.. messy.. loud.. I'd kill for loud.."},false,false,{[4]={{t="she never knew she did it",afterMs=3500},{t="I never told her",afterMs=3200}},[5]={{t="I'm forty-three, and I miss being tucked in by my mother",afterMs=3200}},[6]={{t="I'd trade a lot for that snore",afterMs=3500}},[8]={{t="I miss the clatter of forks",afterMs=3200},{t="and the fighting over the last roll",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_MISS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"I miss being treated like a human being, I miss my rights, I miss the damn mail","I miss the days when people got along, or at least pretended to","I miss my life, damn it, I miss my stupid, ordinary life","I miss when the worst thing was the electric bill"},false,false,{[3]={{t="and I miss the people who took it for granted, including me",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_MISS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"I miss a good hug, honestly, and I think you could give me one, if you wanted","My friends, my silly, wonderful friends, we had so much fun, and I'll see them again, I just know it"}},
{"ASK_MISS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=funny",{"I miss my couch, my remote, and my ability to complain about nothing","I miss the days when \"stranger danger\" meant someone offered you candy","My recliner, my beer, and the Reds losing","Cold cereal at midnight, in my underwear, in front of the fridge light","Bad television, I miss bad television","Flushing a toilet"},false,false,{[3]={{t="in that order",afterMs=3000},{t="I'd even take the loss",afterMs=2800}},[4]={{t="I never realized that was a luxury",afterMs=3200}},[5]={{t="I'd watch an infomercial for a mop right now",afterMs=3000}},[6]={{t="I'm serious, I'd weep",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_MISS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful|mood=fear",{"Not telling"}},
