{"ASK_MUSIC","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"Country, mostly, the old stuff, heartbreak and steel guitar, you can't beat it","Rock and roll, the loud kind, the kind that makes your windows shake, I miss that","Gospel, Sunday mornings, the choir, the piano, I'd give anything for a hymn","Bluegrass, a banjo on the porch on a summer night, that's heaven","Oldies, the fifties and sixties stuff, the music my parents played","I used to play guitar, badly, but loudly, and now my fingers are too stiff","I have a tape player, and one tape, and I've played it so much it's warping","Silence, honestly, I'd take silence over music, right now","Classical... believe it or not, symphonies, opera, I know, I'm a nerd","Country, the sad kind","Gospel, Sunday morning, the harmonies","Bluegrass, a banjo on the porch at dusk","Rock and roll","I like anything with a fiddle","Whatever my mother hummed in the kitchen","Oldies","Church hymns","Polka... believe it or not"},false,false,{[10]={{t="songs about trucks and mamas and heartache",afterMs=3500}},[11]={{t="I'd give a lot to hear those voices",afterMs=3200}},[13]={{t="loud, with the windows down",afterMs=3500}},[15]={{t="I can't name it, but I'd know it",afterMs=3200}},[16]={{t="the kind you slow dance to",afterMs=3500},{t="I danced with my wife to one the night before",afterMs=3000}},[17]={{t="\"Amazing Grace\"",afterMs=3200},{t="I sing it to myself when I'm scared",afterMs=2800}},[18]={{t="my grandpa played accordion",afterMs=3500},{t="I hated it then",afterMs=3000}}}},
