{"ASK_NAME","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"My name? I- sorry, I've gotten used to not saying it, give me a second","Names... right -- names, hold on, it's been a while since anyone asked","You first... I mean, I'm kidding, sort of, I'm just cautious!","I'll tell you -- I'll tell you, it's just, names feel dangerous now","Call me whatever you want, honestly, I've answered to worse","Does it matter? it's not like I'm going to be on a list","I haven't said my name out loud in days, it feels strange","Hold on, I'll answer that in a minute, I'm not ready!","Just call me \"friend,\" for now, if that's alright"}},
{"ASK_NAME","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Names are for people who plan to be remembered","Depends, who's asking, and what for?","You can call me anything but late for supper","I'll give it when I know yours","Not yet, we've barely met","A name's a small thing, but I'm keeping it for now","I answer to a lot of things, \"hey you\" mostly","I'll tell you when I trust you, that's all","Does it help you to know?","Ask me again later, when we're better acquainted"}},
{"ASK_NAME","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"What do you want my name for?","No names -- no questions","That's my business","No, I'm not giving you a name, next question","My name's mine to keep, not yours to ask","You don't need my name","Why? so you can tell someone?"}},
{"ASK_NAME","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Names get you killed, mine's in a ditch somewhere, next question","Call me whatever you like, I'll answer to nothing","My name's Trouble, kid -- ha! Nah, you'd never believe the real one","You don't get a name, you get a warning, lucky you","Name? What do you need that for, a headstone?","I'll tell you my name when you've paid for it","Everybody asks, nobody likes the answer","Ask me nicer, maybe I'll tell you my first one","Boss says never give names to strangers, and boss is right"}},
{"ASK_NAME","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"My name's \"Back off\", last name's \"Now\"","You want my name? YOU WANT MY NAME?! Come closer and I'll write it on you","Keep asking questions like that and you get a name, on your tombstone"}},
{"ASK_NAME","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"Name's Dutch, not my real one but it works, yours?","Folks call me Jonesy, you can too as long as you're polite about it","Hell, why not, short version is Lyle, don't wear it out"}},
{"ASK_NAME","role=raider_boss,gang_boss,biker_boss|st=neutral,careful",{"The boss, that's the only name you need to remember","You'll hear it when it matters"}},
{"ASK_NAME","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"They call me Lil' Mike, don't ask why, seriously, don't","Around the way? Just ask for me, everybody knows","I go by Dre on the block, that's all you're getting","Call me whatever, everybody does, the real name stays home","My mama gave me one, my set gave me another, pick"}},
{"ASK_NAME","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"What's it to you? You collecting names for the cops, snitch?","You don't get to ask me that, nobody does"}},
{"ASK_NAME","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"I'm Deke, you're good, I can tell, welcome to the neighborhood"}},
{"ASK_NAME","role=gang_boss|st=neutral,careful",{"You'll learn it fast enough","Name's all over the block, ask anybody still breathing"}},
{"ASK_NAME","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Road name's Hatchet, that's what the brothers use, yours?","Folks call me Doc, don't ask why, you won't like it","They call me Preacher, and I'm anything but, heh","Sergeant-at-arms is what the patch says, you get the rest when you earn it"}},
