{"ASK_NAME","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Mister Smith, today anyway, and who might you be?","Names are a currency, and I don't spend mine on strangers","I'd prefer you didn't use one, it leaves traces"}},
{"ASK_NAME","reg=crime|st=hostile",{"Ask somebody else, preferably somebody who can't answer"}},
{"ASK_NAME","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"Vince, pleased to make your acquaintance, see how civil this is?"}},
{"ASK_NAME","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Inmate-- no, no I'm not that, I used to have a number, never mind","My name is... it's-- it's Walt, okay? Just Walt, is that enough?","I don't wanna say, they'd come for me if they knew","They called me \"Dutch\" inside, I don't wanna be called that out here"}},
